            <ArticleTitle>Malignant fibrous histiocytoma of the spine causing spinal neural foramen widening.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>329-32</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case with a clinical picture of a chronic low back pain radiating to both lumbar regions caused by malignant fibrous histiocytoma is reported. Radiological, surgical and histopathological findings and treatment of this rare case are discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
